  "description": "为 NCF 桌面应用提供安全的本机状态发现和事件流桥接。",
  "id": "Senparc.Xncf.DesktopBridge",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-11T17:03:53.32Z",
